    ('SO06', 'society', 'en', 'Should a shop let people use its toilet without making a purchase? Consider the situation from both sides.'),
    ('SO06', 'society', 'fr', 'Un commerce devrait-il laisser les gens utiliser ses toilettes sans rien acheter ? Examinez la question des deux points de vue.'),
    ('SO07', 'society', 'en', 'A community garden produces more vegetables than its volunteers can use. Decide how the surplus should be shared.'),
    ('SO07', 'society', 'fr', 'Un jardin partagé produit plus de légumes que ses bénévoles ne peuvent en consommer. Décidez comment répartir le surplus.'),
    ('SO08', 'society', 'en', 'What would you put in a welcome pack for someone who has just moved to your town, beyond maps and advertisements?'),
