    ('TR04', 'travel', 'en', 'You arrive somewhere and discover you have misunderstood a local custom. How would you recover gracefully?'),
    ('TR04', 'travel', 'fr', 'Vous arrivez quelque part et découvrez que vous avez mal compris une coutume locale. Comment réagiriez-vous avec tact ?'),
    ('TR05', 'travel', 'en', 'Would you rather stay in one place for a month or visit four places in the same time? Explain what you would miss either way.'),
